- Using the Work in paid client work or other work performed for compensation.
- Monetizing a project incorporating the Work through advertising,
  sponsorships, subscriptions, paid features, or purchases within the project.
- Incorporating the Work into a business's products, services, internal tools,
  advertising, or promotional materials.
- Soliciting or accepting donations, tips, crowdfunding, or membership support
  to fund, maintain, develop, or provide access to a project incorporating the
