  includes voluntary payments and payments described as covering costs.
- Selling or monetizing recordings, streams, images, videos, or other outputs
  that reproduce or adapt copyright-protected elements of the Work, or using
  those elements in advertising or other commercial content.
- Using the Work as part of a paid performance, commissioned installation,
